WEBVTT

00:23.792 --> 00:28.022
The school is full of whispers The halls are full

00:28.062 --> 00:32.504
of filth. They teach them things I'll never say.

00:32.584 --> 00:35.986
They'll rot them all with guilt. They talk about

00:36.006 --> 00:42.310
those bodies and the dirty things they do. But I

00:42.390 --> 00:47.613
will never let that poison ever get to you. And I

00:47.653 --> 00:53.436
propagate! I check the box. I sign the line. And I

00:53.556 --> 00:58.871
propagate! Your mind will stay as pure as mine.

00:58.891 --> 01:03.695
You do not need to know those things, you'll

01:03.755 --> 01:08.179
never leave my sight. I'll keep you safe, I'll

01:08.219 --> 01:12.123
keep you clean, I'll keep you in the light.

01:17.743 --> 01:21.505
You're not like other children. You're fragile

01:21.685 --> 01:25.166
